<view class="container"><view class="header"><text class="title">关于我们</text></view><view class="content"><view class="section"><view class="section-header"><uni-icons vue-id="1cea7424-1" type="info-filled" size="20" color="#2C8A43" bind:__l="__l"></uni-icons><text class="section-title">软件介绍</text></view><text class="section-content">本软件是一款基于深度学习的农作物病虫害智能识别系统，通过拍照或上传图片即可快速识别农作物的健康状况，并提供专业的防治建议。</text></view><view class="section"><view class="section-header"><uni-icons vue-id="1cea7424-2" type="star-filled" size="20" color="#2C8A43" bind:__l="__l"></uni-icons><text class="section-title">可识别的作物类型</text></view><view class="crop-list"><block wx:for="{{cropTypes}}" wx:for-item="crop" wx:for-index="index" wx:key="index"><view class="crop-item"><uni-icons vue-id="{{'1cea7424-3-'+index}}" type="leaf" size="16" color="#2C8A43" bind:__l="__l"></uni-icons><text class="crop-name">{{crop.name}}</text></view></block></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-header"><uni-icons vue-id="1cea7424-4" type="help-filled" size="20" color="#2C8A43" bind:__l="__l"></uni-icons><text class="section-title">可识别的病害类型</text></view><view class="collapse-list"><block wx:for="{{groupedDiseases}}" wx:for-item="crop" wx:for-index="cropIndex" wx:key="cropIndex"><view class="collapse-item"><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['toggleCollapse',[cropIndex]]]]]}}" class="collapse-header" bindtap="__e"><text class="crop-name">{{crop.cropName}}</text><uni-icons vue-id="{{'1cea7424-5-'+cropIndex}}" type="{{crop.isOpen?'arrow-up':'arrow-down'}}" size="16" color="#666" bind:__l="__l"></uni-icons></view><view hidden="{{!(crop.isOpen)}}" class="collapse-content"><block wx:for="{{crop.diseases}}" wx:for-item="disease" wx:for-index="diseaseIndex" wx:key="diseaseIndex"><view class="disease-item"><text class="disease-name">{{disease.name}}</text><text class="disease-desc">{{disease.description}}</text></view></block></view></view></block></view></view></view></view>